│ number of indeterminate results."}, {"study_index": 1095, "title": "Helicobacter pylori serology at diagnosis and    │
│ follow‐up of biopsy‐verified infection in children", "abstract": "Data on the use of Helicobacter pylori serology in │
│ children are limited. We studied the serum antibodies of 105 H. pylori-infected children (median age 9.1 y, range    │
│ 1.5-17.5 y) using an in-house enzyme immunoassay. At diagnosis of the biopsy-verified infection, IgG antibodies to   │
