│ children. The length of follow-up needed after eradication, however, is unclear."}, {"study_index": 1096, "title":   │
│ "Correlation of c‐13 urea breath test values with Helicobacter pylori load among positive patients", "abstract":     │
│ "BACKGROUND/AIMS 13C urea breath test (13C UBT) is used to detect Helicbacter (H.) pylori in gastric mucosa. There   │
