│ {"study_index": 1098, "title": "Comparison of genotyping of Helicobacter pylori caga and vaca virulence genes from   │
│ gastric biopsies and stool specimens", "abstract": "BACKGROUND We compared results of genotyping of Helicobacter     │
│ pylori cagA and vacA virulence genes in DNA from gastric biopsies, both paraffin-embedded and frozen, and from stool │
│ samples, in order to evaluate the comparative sensitivity of the stool assay. METHODS Genomic DNA from               │
