│ 96.2% of the composite genotypes. Evidence of multiple genotypes was found in 10 of 20 (50%) of the cases.           │
│ CONCLUSIONS Any one of the investigated biological materials can be used for detection of cagA and vacA genes, but   │
│ no single assay provided a complete genotype. The use of a combination of two materials may generate a more accurate │
